{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53185","headline":"诗偈 十 · 庞藴","name":"诗偈 十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"故宅守真妻，不好求外色。\n真妻生男女，长大同荣辱。\n外色有男女，长成爱作贼。\n有妻累我来，牵我入牢狱。\n我亦早识渠，诱引入吾室。\n内外总团圆，同飡一鉢食。\n食饱断虚妄，无相即无福。\n若论真寂理，同归无所得。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"庞藴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53185.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53185","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}